a log entry. **C is wrong** because pause and resume act on an in-flight rollout [source: k8s-docs-deployment-2026-08-23] and have nothing to do with retained ReplicaSets. **D is wrong** in the most useful way: `undo` with no arguments goes to the *previous* revision, and that is precisely the revision that no longer exists.\n1421:| **Rollback** | Restore a previous template and run the same rolling update backwards. Ten old ReplicaSets retained by default; `revisionHistoryLimit: 0` removes the ability to undo [source: k8s-docs-deployment-spec-fields-2026-08-24]. |","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
